      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Ny Dear Friends: God bless you and yours. Many thanks indeed for your charitable favor noted yesterday. I came just in nice time - especially the smaller cheque - to enroll quite a number of my friends in the Ser Mass Assoc'n for a Christmas gifte. - a double, tripple charity. Thinking you were down in Texas for the Winter I addressed a letter to you only last week - to Palmer Hotel Ko Allen Texas - the address as - indicated on the baskets of fine fruit that came to us in your name - and for which = want to thank you again - for the twofine baskets of delicious fruit. You will very likely receive the letter formarded withe relics of V.Nother Hary of Jesus, of Agreda, which had inclosed.",
      "per_polygon": "My Dear Friends: God bless you and yours. Many thanks indeed for your charitable favor noted yesterday. I came just in nice time - especially the smaller cheque - to enroll quite a number of my friends in the Ser Mass Assoc'n for a Christmas gifte. - a double, tripple charity. Thinking you were down in Texas for the Winter I addressed a letter to you only last week - to Palner Hotel Mc Allen Texas - the address as - indicated on the baskets of fine fruit that came to us in your name - and for which I want to thank you again - for the twofine baskets of delicious fruit. You will very likely receive the letter forwarded withe relics of V.Nother fary of Jesus, of Agreda, which had inclosed.",
